Package: ProteoVaultR
Title: Query Linked Proteomics Results from ProteoVault Databases
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chenghao", "Zhu", email = "czhu@sbpdiscovery.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Boutros Lab", role = "cph"))
Description: Read proteomics results saved by ProteoVault as DuckDB databases.
    Provides read-only connections, lazy queries for quantification and
    identification results, protein-group membership, quantitative matrices,
    and per-sample summaries while preserving source and method provenance.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
